>Related, once the named demons are offed, do they stay dead (I
>know the Wizard doesn't)?

Yes.  Only three monsters come back from the dead: trolls, the Wizard,
and the Four Riders of the Apocolypse (in the endgame).  Actually, 
those are the only that come back on their own... you can bring anything
that leaves a corpse back by zapping a wand of undead turning at the 
corpse.

